803	     * interest earned so far and then the instalment itself, earliest instalment first. An instalment
804	     * still not paid off more than {@link #graceDays()} days after its due date earns interest by the
805	     * same rule as an invoice: from the end of its own grace period, compounded daily at rate / 360 (Actual/360), on
806	     * what is still unpaid of it, with each payment after its grace period ending a period.
